 * Wiring:
 *   HDC2010 SDA  -> GPIO2 (pin 3, I2C bus 1)
 *   HDC2010 SCL  -> GPIO3 (pin 5, I2C bus 1)
 *   HDC2010 VDD  -> 3.3 V
 *   HDC2010 GND  -> GND
 *
 * Build:  gcc -O2 -Wall -Wextra -o hdc2010_logger hdc2010_logger.c -lpigpio -lrt
 * Run:    sudo ./hdc2010_logger
 */

