 *
 * Hardware:
 *   - TTP223 capacitive touch sensor (active-high)
 *     OUTPUT  -> BCM 23 (GPIO23)
 *     VCC     -> 3.3 V
 *     GND     -> GND
 *   - LED + 330 Ω resistor
 *     anode   -> BCM 24 (GPIO24)
 *     cathode -> GND
 *
 * Behavior:
 *   Polls rising-edge events on GPIO23 every second.  On each event the
 *   LED is toggled and the timestamp + state are appended to
 *   touch_log.txt.  SIGINT/SIGTERM triggers graceful shutdown.
